                      &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                             =
                   &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                 =
                   &lt;p&gt;Now, enter =E2=80=9Ccontrol/name Microsoft.DevicesAnd=
Printers.=E2=80=9D=0A                                                      =
              &lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                      =
          &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                                         =
       &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                             =
       &lt;p&gt;After that, click the OK button.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                          =
