                                                &lt;p&gt;Next, connect the printe=
r to the wireless network.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                          =
                      &lt;/li&gt;=0A                                             =
                   &lt;li&gt;=0A                                                 =
                   &lt;p&gt;Now, go to the official page and download the printer=
=0A                                                                        =
driver.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                                                             =
